a6a27441-f236-4e36-969d-af40967676d7	717079f5-3936-4bcf-ac35-e98753224736	assistant	To find the average age of losers and winners of all matches, we need to calculate the age of each player at the time of the match and then find the average age for losers and winners separately.\n\n```sql\nSELECT \n    AVG(CASE WHEN m.loser_id IS NOT NULL THEN \n        (strftime('%Y', m.tourney_date) - strftime('%Y', p.loser_birth_date)) - \n        (CASE WHEN strftime('%m%d', m.tourney_date) < strftime('%m%d', p.loser_birth_date) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) \n    END) AS avg_loser_age,\n    AVG(CASE WHEN m.winner_id IS NOT NULL THEN \n        (strftime('%Y', m.tourney_date) - strftime('%Y', p.winner_birth_date)) - \n        (CASE WHEN strftime('%m%d', m.tourney_date) < strftime('%m%d', p.winner_birth_date) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) \n    END) AS avg_winner_age\nFROM \n    matches m\nJOIN \n    players p ON m.winner_id = p.player_id OR m.loser_id = p.player_id;\n```\n\nHowever, the query above might not work as expected because it joins the players table twice (once for winner and once for loser), which can lead to incorrect results. A better approach would be to use subqueries or join the players table twice:\n\n```sql\nSELECT \n    AVG(CASE WHEN m.loser_age IS NOT NULL THEN m.loser_age END) AS avg_loser_age,\n    AVG(CASE WHEN m.winner_age IS NOT NULL THEN m.winner_age END) AS avg_winner_age\nFROM \n    matches m;\n```\n\nThis query directly uses the provided `loser_age` and `winner_age` in the `matches` table, which already contains the ages of losers and winners at the time of the match. \n\nIf you want to calculate age from birth date for verification:\n\n```sql\nSELECT \n    AVG((strftime('%Y', m.tourney_date) - strftime('%Y', p.birth_date)) - \n        (CASE WHEN strftime('%m%d', m.tourney_date) < strftime('%m%d', p.birth_date) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)) AS avg_player_age\nFROM \n    players p\nJOIN \n    matches m ON p.player_id = m.winner_id OR p.player_id = m.loser_id;\n```	SELECT \n    AVG(CASE WHEN m.loser_id IS NOT NULL THEN \n        (strftime('%Y', m.tourney_date) - strftime('%Y', p.loser_birth_date)) - \n        (CASE WHEN strftime('%m%d', m.tourney_date) < strftime('%m%d', p.loser_birth_date) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) \n    END) AS avg_loser_age,\n    AVG(CASE WHEN m.winner_id IS NOT NULL THEN \n        (strftime('%Y', m.tourney_date) - strftime('%Y', p.winner_birth_date)) - \n        (CASE WHEN strftime('%m%d', m.tourney_date) < strftime('%m%d', p.winner_birth_date) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) \n    END) AS avg_winner_age\nFROM \n    matches m\nJOIN \n    players p ON m.winner_id = p.player_id OR m.loser_id = p.player_id;	2026-05-01 11:07:24.787592+07	chat	null
